## local.properties'ga nusxalab, haqiqiy qiymatlarni qo'ying (Supabase Dashboard → Settings → API).
## SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY — publishable/anon kalit, client uchun xavfsiz.
## service_role kalitni HECH QACHON bu yerga yoki ilova kodiga qo'ymang.

SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
